00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:00.760 line:100%
Use this.

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:03.360 line:100%
I checked.

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:05.080 line:100%
After you clean it with this,
no one will notice.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:09.160 line:20%
STRONG BLEACHING POWDER

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:54.080 line:100%
Sister,

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:57.960 line:100%
these three days…

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.680 line:100%
SATURDAY JUNE 28, SUNDAY JUNE 29

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.680 line:100%
…I'll act like nothing happened.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:02.680 line:100%
MONDAY JUNE 30

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:06.920 line:100%
I'll make everyone believe
Xu Zhihong is still alive.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:15.960 line:100%
After three days,
I'll stage a disappearance.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:18.720 line:100%
But I need your help.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:21.320 line:100%
Disappearance?

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:24.040 line:100%
You know about

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:27.200 line:100%
the cursed building rumor
of Yuanlongli, right?

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.360 line:100%
I want to use that rumor

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.200 line:100%
to make everyone believe

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:37.080 line:100%
that Xu Zhihong and I

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:40.000 line:100%
were both taken by that building.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:42.360 line:100%
Why do it this way?

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.280 line:100%
Why not just leave quietly?
Wouldn't that be easier?

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:50.880 line:100%
It's not that simple.

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.160 line:100%
I borrowed from loan sharks.

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:56.360 line:100%
And Song Qingsong
from the cement factory was watching me.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.080 line:100%
He made it clear

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:02.200 line:100%
he wants me gone from Weiyang.

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:03.840 line:100%
But that works out too.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:09.640 line:100%
Even if the police find out
we disappeared on purpose,

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:13.520 line:100%
we can still shift the blame
onto Song Qingsong.

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:17.720 line:100%
At least they won't suspect
Xu Zhihong's death.

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:21.680 line:100%
But… But…

00:04:21.759 --> 00:04:23.920 line:100%
If you leave, what am I supposed to do?

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:28.480 line:100%
Sister, stay here for now.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:32.800 line:100%
If Xu Zhihong and I disappear
and then you leave too,

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:34.840 line:100%
the police will definitely suspect you.

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:38.600 line:100%
Besides, no one knows
that we even know each other.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:43.600 line:100%
How long do I stay?

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:45.480 line:100%
This place…

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:48.000 line:100%
I… I can't live here anymore.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.560 line:100%
Sister, hold on
until Yao Xincheng returns.

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:01.280 line:100%
He'll sell the house
and give you the money.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.600 line:100%
Otherwise, all the hardship
will be for nothing.

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:14.440 line:100%
Then… what about you?

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:17.000 line:100%
Where will you go?

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:19.400 line:100%
I…

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:21.960 line:100%
I'll find a place

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:26.440 line:100%
where nobody knows who we are

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:29.800 line:100%
and build a safe home.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:32.360 line:100%
I'll wait for you there.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:34.360 line:100%
Sister,

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:40.280 line:100%
no one can give us safety.

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:45.000 line:100%
We can only rely on ourselves.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:54.840 line:100%
Don't be scared.

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:00.440 line:20%
JUNE 30, 26TH DAY OF THE MONTH, MONDAY

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:30.760 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:08:35.959 --> 00:08:38.800 line:100%
<i>Xu Zhihong's body</i>
<i>was disposed of in stages.</i>

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:41.320 line:100%
<i>Xu Meng kept the head and hands for last.</i>

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:43.640 line:100%
<i>When I impersonated Xu Zhihong,</i>

00:08:43.719 --> 00:08:45.920 line:100%
<i>I needed his hand</i>
<i>to press the elevator buttons</i>

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.240 line:100%
<i>and leave fingerprints.</i>

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:49.720 line:20%
<i>After it was done,</i>

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.760 line:20%
<i>I got a tool bag and packed them inside.</i>

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.040 line:100%
<i>Xu Meng disposed of them.</i>

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:08.760 line:100%
<i>Xu Meng finally left</i>
<i>through the underground garage.</i>

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:10.600 line:100%
That's the whole process.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.800 line:100%
The elevator door and the garage key,

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:16.600 line:100%
where did they come from?

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:19.200 line:100%
The elevator key is universal.

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:21.400 line:100%
You can buy it at a hardware store.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:25.040 line:100%
As for the garage key,
Xu Meng already had one.

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.960 line:100%
She used to work at Pattia

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.520 line:100%
and always used the underground access.

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:33.200 line:100%
That's quite thorough planning.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.320 line:100%
We thought the plan was solid too.

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:39.080 line:100%
But something still went wrong.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:12.960 line:100%
Come on. Why are you hiding?

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:10.520 line:100%
-Hello?
-<i>It's me.</i>

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.640 line:100%
I was spotted by Song Qingsong's driver.

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:27.320 line:100%
<i>I'm locked up.</i>

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:29.080 line:100%
Did he do anything to you?

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:30.280 line:100%
Don't worry.

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:32.640 line:100%
He can't do anything.

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:35.240 line:100%
<i>He's just a sick pervert.</i>

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:37.960 line:100%
<i>I've figured out how to deal with him.</i>

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:42.320 line:100%
By the way, that tool bag…

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:44.120 line:100%
What about it?

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:46.920 line:100%
It's nothing.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:48.960 line:100%
I already burned it.

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:54.200 line:100%
I'm doing what you said,

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:55.600 line:100%
writing the rhyme on flyers.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:57.960 line:100%
<i>I'll hand them out tomorrow.</i>

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:01.000 line:100%
Don't wait till tomorrow. Go now.

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:04.520 line:100%
Everyone's watching
the comeback livestream.

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:06.920 line:100%
The streets will be empty.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:10.560 line:100%
<i>Also, that dress you gave me,</i>
<i>the Bowls one,</i>

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:12.160 line:100%
<i>I forgot to take it.</i>

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:14.600 line:100%
It can be traced back
to Yao Xincheng's purchase record.

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:17.320 line:100%
-<i>We need to erase it.</i>
-Okay.

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:20.480 line:100%
The police were in Yuanlongli all day
investigating the disappearance.

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:21.800 line:100%
I'm worried the place

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:24.920 line:100%
<i>where we buried it might not be safe.</i>

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:27.800 line:100%
I'll find a way to get out tomorrow,

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:30.720 line:100%
<i>dig it up, and burn it.</i>

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:32.400 line:100%
<i>Even if it's found,</i>

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.120 line:100%
<i>they won't identify the body.</i>

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:35.640 line:100%
I'll go instead.

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:40.680 line:100%
Just keep yourself safe.

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:52.000 line:100%
<i>The next day,</i>

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:54.800 line:100%
<i>I went to where the body was buried,</i>

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:57.680 line:100%
<i>dug it up,</i>

00:12:57.760 --> 00:13:00.640 line:100%
and burned it along with the blue heels.

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:01.960 line:100%
Then buried it again.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:04.640 line:100%
I was covered in dirt,

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:06.760 line:100%
afraid the police might see me,

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:09.840 line:100%
so I bought a potted plant

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:13.160 line:100%
to make it look like
the dirt came from that.

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:16.640 line:100%
Turns out…

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:19.400 line:100%
Watch out.

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:38.760 line:100%
<i>Maybe it's because</i>
<i>I've been on edge for too long…</i>

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:45.360 line:100%
How about you come in and wash up?

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:51.040 line:100%
<i>I kept worrying the police</i>
<i>would show up at my door.</i>

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:54.760 line:100%
<i>But when I saw Ran that time,</i>

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:56.640 line:100%
<i>I felt like</i>

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.600 line:100%
<i>the police weren't that scary after all.</i>

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:02.840 line:100%
<i>So I thought I'd let him</i>
<i>come in and take a look.</i>

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.080 line:100%
Once he saw,

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:09.800 line:100%
maybe after that,
I wouldn't be so nervous anymore.

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:26.360 line:100%
This photo. What's going on?

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:33.200 line:100%
It was Wu Shanlong
who forced Xu Meng to take it.

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:51.640 line:100%
Get in.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:53.240 line:100%
I'm not going.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.960 line:100%
You think you've got
other options right now?

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.680 line:100%
I tell you to do something, you do it.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:06.600 line:100%
Wu Shanlong, aren't you afraid
of keeping me around?

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:10.720 line:100%
One day, I might slip
and expose how you scammed

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.760 line:100%
-Song Qingsong.
-You…

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:15.800 line:100%
Try it.

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:18.000 line:100%
I'll kill you right now.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.440 line:100%
Then go ahead.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:22.160 line:100%
I already told my dad
everything about you.

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:23.960 line:100%
He's already left Weiyang.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.800 line:100%
If I die, what do you think he'll do?

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:36.880 line:100%
<i>Xu Meng couldn't reveal herself,</i>

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:39.640 line:100%
<i>so she kept moving around</i>
<i>doing under-the-table jobs.</i>

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:43.720 line:100%
During that time,
we barely stayed in touch.

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:47.240 line:100%
Until the spring of 2002,

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:50.200 line:100%
she suddenly called me.

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:52.920 line:100%
Said she'd saved enough money

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:56.800 line:100%
and wanted to go back
to where we first met

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:02.000 line:100%
and build a small house.

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:04.600 line:100%
I was so excited.

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:09.040 line:100%
I immediately called Yao Xincheng
to ask when he'd be back.

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:13.280 line:100%
Yao Xincheng said he planned
to return by year's end.

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:16.720 line:100%
When that happens, he'll keep his promise,

00:16:16.800 --> 00:16:19.880 line:100%
sell the house, and give me the money.

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:22.280 line:100%
Hearing that,

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:28.400 line:100%
we got so excited,
stayed on the phone all night long.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:35.560 line:100%
Back then, it felt like hope

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:39.680 line:100%
was finally within reach.

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:55.600 line:100%
<i>But not long after, something happened.</i>

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.560 line:100%
Hi there. I'm from property management.

00:17:04.639 --> 00:17:06.360 line:100%
I'm here to check the TV lines.

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:09.480 line:100%
Lately, people have been complaining
about poor signal.

00:17:11.119 --> 00:17:13.639 line:100%
You… You're from property management?

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:16.399 line:100%
I just started last week.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.119 line:100%
Hey, have we met before?

00:17:23.879 --> 00:17:24.720 line:100%
Well…

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:39.040 line:100%
<i>I'd seen Wu Shanlong before</i>
<i>at Qihuang Clinic,</i>

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:41.840 line:100%
<i>but he didn't recognize me.</i>

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:49.640 line:100%
Alright, the lines are fine.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:52.680 line:100%
I'll head to the next place.

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:56.800 line:100%
Thanks.

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:29.160 line:100%
<i>I wanted to call the police,</i>

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:32.360 line:100%
<i>but I was afraid</i>
<i>if Wu Shanlong got arrested,</i>

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:35.080 line:100%
<i>he'd expose Xu Meng.</i>

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:36.880 line:100%
<i>So I held it in.</i>

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:41.400 line:100%
<i>I kept the windows shut</i>
<i>and the curtains closed every day.</i>

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:49.640 line:100%
After finally getting
a few years of sunlight,

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:54.080 line:100%
I had to block it out again.

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:59.320 line:100%
So Wu Shanlong didn't know
your connection to Xu Meng

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:01.720 line:100%
and never threatened you?

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:06.920 line:100%
We approached him first.

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:11.040 line:100%
<i>At that time,</i>

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:15.520 line:100%
<i>Xu Zhihong's head</i>
<i>was found on the rooftop.</i>

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:17.760 line:100%
<i>I was so scared,</i>
<i>I couldn't sleep for days.</i>

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:32.840 line:100%
REWARD NOTICE: 8,000 YUAN FOR USEFUL LEADS

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:39.480 line:100%
Back then,

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:42.480 line:100%
Wu Shanlong ran into me in the garage.

00:19:43.560 --> 00:19:45.240 line:100%
I had no choice.

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:48.760 line:100%
I had to hide the tool bag nearby.

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:53.280 line:100%
A few days later, when I went back for it,

00:19:57.480 --> 00:20:01.400 line:100%
I realized it was gone.

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:08.400 line:100%
I didn't tell you
because I didn't want you to worry.

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:11.880 line:100%
Meng,

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:15.160 line:100%
run.

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.720 line:100%
The farther, the better.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:26.440 line:100%
Sister,

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:29.400 line:100%
I've been running for years.

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:33.520 line:100%
I don't want to run anymore.

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:36.520 line:100%
What if…

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:42.200 line:100%
What if the police find us? What do we do?

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:49.280 line:100%
There's someone

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:54.320 line:100%
who can die in our place.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:59.040 line:100%
<i>Xu Meng dug up</i>
<i>Xu Zhihong's bone fragments.</i>

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:01.800 line:100%
I made fake shoes.

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:06.760 line:100%
Then Xu Meng snuck into
Wu Shanlong's place

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:10.120 line:100%
and put the fragments in the drain

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:13.520 line:100%
and placed the fake shoes on the rack.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:19.920 line:100%
The trap that killed Wu Shanlong…
Xu Meng taught me how to make it.

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:24.920 line:100%
That day, she was even ready
to do it herself.

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:28.120 line:100%
The day Wu Shanlong was arrested,
Xu Meng was there too?

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:46.080 line:100%
He!

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:48.800 line:100%
He! Hey, He, don't fall asleep!

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:50.480 line:100%
He!

00:21:56.280 --> 00:21:59.720 line:100%
<i>After Wu Shanlong died,</i>
<i>Xu Meng left Weiyang.</i>

00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:03.320 line:100%
<i>In the winter of 2002,</i>

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:06.880 line:100%
<i>Yao Xincheng asked me to sell the house.</i>

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:09.120 line:100%
I got the money,

00:22:10.520 --> 00:22:12.280 line:100%
but I didn't tell Xu Meng.

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:14.720 line:100%
Why?

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:21.440 line:100%
Because at that time,

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:24.120 line:100%
I realized…

00:22:35.520 --> 00:22:37.680 line:100%
I had fallen for Ran.

00:22:51.360 --> 00:22:53.160 line:100%
I knew it was dangerous,

00:22:54.800 --> 00:22:57.640 line:100%
but I still wanted to be with him.

00:23:01.960 --> 00:23:03.920 line:100%
<i>When I was with him,</i>

00:23:06.680 --> 00:23:08.440 line:100%
I felt safe.

00:23:20.440 --> 00:23:22.680 line:100%
Back then, after Uncle Ran found you,

00:23:24.200 --> 00:23:25.520 line:100%
did he come to you?

00:23:31.480 --> 00:23:33.200 line:100%
SIR, THE JUNE 30TH CASE WAS WRONG

00:23:36.880 --> 00:23:38.640 line:20%
SIR, THE JUNE 30TH CASE
WAS WRONG, ALL WRONG

00:23:38.720 --> 00:23:40.520 line:20%
SEND

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:45.720 line:100%
QIAO

00:23:58.840 --> 00:23:59.680 line:100%
Ran.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:02.800 line:100%
What's wrong? Why rush over?

00:24:08.840 --> 00:24:09.800 line:100%
Do I look good?

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:22.520 line:100%
Let's go somewhere quiet.

00:24:27.200 --> 00:24:28.160 line:100%
Sure.

00:24:41.360 --> 00:24:42.280 line:100%
What's wrong?

00:24:42.880 --> 00:24:44.480 line:100%
Why are you so distracted?

00:24:49.240 --> 00:24:52.000 line:100%
Is something wrong at work?

00:24:56.200 --> 00:24:58.840 line:100%
Is it… a tough case?

00:25:01.120 --> 00:25:01.960 line:100%
Qiao.

00:25:05.360 --> 00:25:07.320 line:100%
Do you remember when we first met?

00:25:09.240 --> 00:25:10.400 line:100%
Of course I do.

00:25:11.520 --> 00:25:12.640 line:100%
Back then…

00:25:12.720 --> 00:25:14.200 line:100%
Back then, I was investigating
on the 18th floor.

00:25:16.200 --> 00:25:17.720 line:100%
You were covered in dirt,

00:25:18.520 --> 00:25:21.440 line:100%
holding a pot of orchids,
walking into the building.

00:25:24.080 --> 00:25:25.400 line:100%
You're such a neat person.

00:25:26.320 --> 00:25:28.760 line:100%
Why would you press
the pot against your clothes

00:25:29.400 --> 00:25:30.960 line:100%
and get dirt all over yourself?

00:25:34.720 --> 00:25:38.240 line:100%
Because you already
had dirt on you, right?

00:25:41.120 --> 00:25:42.120 line:100%
Ran,

00:25:43.600 --> 00:25:45.520 line:100%
why would you say that?

00:25:47.760 --> 00:25:48.920 line:100%
You were dumping a body, weren't you?

00:25:52.600 --> 00:25:54.600 line:100%
Ran, don't scare me.

00:25:55.440 --> 00:25:57.840 line:100%
What… What body?

00:25:57.920 --> 00:25:59.400 line:100%
That sounds scary.

00:26:02.400 --> 00:26:04.440 line:100%
It was Xu Meng and her father.

00:26:05.520 --> 00:26:08.120 line:100%
Xu Meng and her father?
What does that have to do with me?

00:26:09.080 --> 00:26:11.480 line:100%
-Weren't they killed by Wu Shanlong?
-Qiao,

00:26:14.160 --> 00:26:15.480 line:100%
stop lying.

00:26:16.960 --> 00:26:19.800 line:100%
Yao Xincheng, the Bowls dress,

00:26:19.880 --> 00:26:21.200 line:100%
the red heels turned blue,

00:26:21.880 --> 00:26:26.160 line:100%
and what happened in restroom 415,
I've figured it all out.

00:26:31.160 --> 00:26:32.280 line:100%
All these years,

00:26:33.400 --> 00:26:36.360 line:100%
how could you act
like nothing happened when facing me

00:26:38.200 --> 00:26:39.240 line:100%
and facing Sir?

00:26:40.760 --> 00:26:44.160 line:100%
You hid it so well, for so long.

00:26:44.920 --> 00:26:46.240 line:100%
I… I didn't…

00:26:51.120 --> 00:26:53.800 line:100%
I didn't mean to hide it from you.

00:26:56.240 --> 00:26:57.720 line:100%
I didn't.

00:27:02.800 --> 00:27:04.040 line:100%
All these years,

00:27:07.640 --> 00:27:10.560 line:100%
I just wanted to crawl
out of the darkness.

00:27:11.560 --> 00:27:14.400 line:100%
I just wanted to feel the sun again.

00:27:15.840 --> 00:27:18.040 line:100%
Why is it so hard?

00:27:22.120 --> 00:27:25.320 line:100%
Ran, tell me.

00:27:26.600 --> 00:27:28.840 line:100%
Why is it so hard?

00:27:40.960 --> 00:27:42.080 line:100%
Qiao,

00:27:43.680 --> 00:27:44.800 line:100%
turn yourself in.

00:28:24.920 --> 00:28:28.520 line:100%
Tomorrow morning, I'll turn myself in.

00:28:30.880 --> 00:28:31.880 line:100%
I'll go with you.

00:28:36.880 --> 00:28:38.840 line:100%
But tonight,

00:28:39.840 --> 00:28:41.320 line:100%
can I stay with you,

00:28:42.400 --> 00:28:45.960 line:100%
with Officer He and Xiaohe,

00:28:49.680 --> 00:28:54.680 line:100%
like a family and have a reunion dinner?

00:28:56.080 --> 00:28:58.760 line:100%
This is my New Year's wish.

00:28:59.600 --> 00:29:04.480 line:100%
It's also been my only wish
all these years.

00:29:20.280 --> 00:29:21.280 line:100%
Eight p.m.

00:29:22.560 --> 00:29:23.520 line:100%
I'll pick you up.

00:29:25.480 --> 00:29:26.760 line:100%
We'll go to Sir's place together.

00:29:43.440 --> 00:29:44.680 line:100%
I'm sorry.

00:29:49.760 --> 00:29:51.560 line:100%
I failed Ran.

00:29:55.280 --> 00:29:57.280 line:100%
If he hadn't come to get me,

00:30:00.560 --> 00:30:02.800 line:100%
he wouldn't have been killed by Xu Meng.

00:30:09.960 --> 00:30:11.680 line:100%
I failed him.

00:30:20.200 --> 00:30:21.080 line:100%
Qiao Suqing,

00:30:21.840 --> 00:30:24.080 line:100%
why do you say it was Xu Meng
who killed Captain Ran?

00:30:24.880 --> 00:30:26.000 line:100%
That afternoon,

00:30:27.920 --> 00:30:29.120 line:100%
I called her

00:30:30.320 --> 00:30:31.960 line:100%
and told her Ran had figured me out.

00:30:34.200 --> 00:30:35.360 line:100%
I told her everything.

00:30:36.320 --> 00:30:37.480 line:100%
What did Xu Meng say?

00:30:39.960 --> 00:30:43.960 line:100%
She said she'd turn herself in with me.

00:30:45.600 --> 00:30:46.680 line:100%
And after that--

00:30:46.760 --> 00:30:48.360 line:100%
So she lied to me!

00:30:49.360 --> 00:30:51.000 line:100%
She lied to me!

00:30:52.520 --> 00:30:54.440 line:100%
She said she was in Kunhai

00:30:56.320 --> 00:30:59.720 line:100%
and would take the earliest train
to Weiyang the next day.

00:31:03.240 --> 00:31:04.520 line:100%
The next morning,

00:31:06.360 --> 00:31:07.920 line:100%
she came to my place.

00:31:13.000 --> 00:31:16.240 line:100%
I even saw her with that day's ticket!

00:31:18.160 --> 00:31:19.880 line:100%
She's a liar!

00:31:20.520 --> 00:31:21.800 line:100%
A liar!

00:31:22.440 --> 00:31:25.280 line:100%
By your account,
Xu Meng had no time to commit it.

00:31:30.720 --> 00:31:33.320 line:100%
It was Xu Meng. She killed Ran.

00:31:36.080 --> 00:31:37.640 line:100%
It had to be her.

00:31:51.200 --> 00:31:54.120 line:100%
CAPTAIN QU
WE'VE GOT HER. INTERROGATION ROOM 2

00:32:01.440 --> 00:32:02.960 line:100%
INTERROGATION ROOM 1

00:32:20.920 --> 00:32:26.000 line:100%
INTERROGATION ROOM 2

00:32:36.480 --> 00:32:37.320 line:100%
<i>Xiaohe.</i>

00:33:20.920 --> 00:33:23.800 line:100%
Don't worry. I've got you.

00:34:11.959 --> 00:34:13.120 line:100%
Xu Meng.

00:34:22.280 --> 00:34:23.959 line:100%
You caught me,

00:34:24.959 --> 00:34:27.080 line:100%
so you must've caught Qiao Suqing too.

00:34:28.600 --> 00:34:31.680 line:100%
Officer, you've got it wrong.

00:34:33.120 --> 00:34:35.479 line:100%
Everything… I did it.

00:34:37.080 --> 00:34:39.160 line:100%
Qiao Suqing had nothing to do with it.

00:34:39.240 --> 00:34:42.920 line:100%
Whether she was involved
is for us to decide.

00:34:43.920 --> 00:34:47.360 line:100%
She's already confessed.
Now it's your turn.

00:34:47.959 --> 00:34:50.760 line:100%
Xu Meng, you faked your death
for 18 years.

00:34:50.840 --> 00:34:53.920 line:100%
We found you and brought you here.

00:34:53.999 --> 00:34:56.080 line:100%
Stop thinking you'll get lucky.

00:34:56.160 --> 00:34:58.040 line:100%
Don't try to protect anyone either.

00:34:58.120 --> 00:35:00.800 line:100%
Tell the truth. It's your only way out.

00:35:05.040 --> 00:35:06.720 line:100%
It's not that I won't talk.

00:35:07.320 --> 00:35:09.040 line:100%
It's just, when I think about it,

00:35:11.040 --> 00:35:13.120 line:100%
there's just too much I've done.

00:35:15.600 --> 00:35:17.960 line:100%
I don't even know where to start.

00:35:18.040 --> 00:35:19.840 line:100%
Then take it one by one.

00:35:19.920 --> 00:35:21.080 line:100%
Start from the beginning!

00:35:22.360 --> 00:35:23.840 line:100%
The first one…

00:35:24.440 --> 00:35:25.600 line:100%
Yao.

00:35:26.480 --> 00:35:31.680 line:100%
It should've been in 1996.

00:35:50.040 --> 00:35:51.320 line:100%
Hello.

00:36:33.520 --> 00:36:34.360 line:100%
Ghost!

00:36:50.480 --> 00:36:54.680 line:100%
<i>I originally just wanted</i>
<i>to teach Yao a lesson,</i>

00:36:55.720 --> 00:36:59.400 line:100%
<i>make him crippled,</i>
<i>so he couldn't abuse Suqing.</i>

00:37:00.640 --> 00:37:03.880 line:100%
<i>I didn't expect he'd actually die.</i>

00:37:04.880 --> 00:37:09.200 line:100%
<i>I watched him stop moving.</i>

00:37:11.880 --> 00:37:16.520 line:100%
<i>I wasn't scared at all.</i>
<i>I actually felt relieved.</i>

00:37:18.240 --> 00:37:19.600 line:100%
<i>Suqing…</i>

00:37:21.160 --> 00:37:22.560 line:100%
<i>She was finally free.</i>

00:37:27.720 --> 00:37:29.080 line:100%
Who else did you kill?

00:37:30.360 --> 00:37:31.480 line:100%
Xu Zhihong.

00:37:33.000 --> 00:37:34.200 line:100%
I pushed him.

00:37:35.760 --> 00:37:37.080 line:100%
<i>I watched him die too.</i>

00:37:46.160 --> 00:37:47.680 line:100%
<i>Then I cut up his body</i>

00:37:48.880 --> 00:37:50.240 line:100%
and dumped it in the woods.

00:37:51.200 --> 00:37:52.880 line:100%
Then,

00:37:55.480 --> 00:37:57.280 line:100%
in the summer of 2002,

00:37:59.120 --> 00:38:01.320 line:100%
in Yuanlongli's garage,

00:38:02.080 --> 00:38:07.120 line:100%
I used the same method to set a trap

00:38:08.360 --> 00:38:10.760 line:100%
and killed that sick Wu Shanlong.

00:38:10.840 --> 00:38:11.840 line:100%
Xu Meng,

00:38:13.240 --> 00:38:16.440 line:100%
what we've learned
doesn't match your statement.

00:38:17.280 --> 00:38:18.880 line:100%
Think carefully before you answer.

00:38:21.920 --> 00:38:25.680 line:100%
You mean that Qiao Suqing was involved?

00:38:28.960 --> 00:38:32.400 line:100%
It's been too long.
I don't remember the details.

00:38:32.480 --> 00:38:35.360 line:100%
Either way, I came up with the plans.

00:38:36.040 --> 00:38:38.880 line:100%
I… was the mastermind.

00:38:38.960 --> 00:38:43.640 line:100%
So, using grease at the scene
is your usual method?

00:38:45.280 --> 00:38:46.880 line:100%
Not always.

00:38:48.880 --> 00:38:51.080 line:100%
In winter 2002,

00:38:51.160 --> 00:38:53.600 line:100%
I also set a fire
and burned a child to death.

00:38:55.280 --> 00:38:56.440 line:100%
Be specific.

00:38:56.520 --> 00:38:59.280 line:100%
Where did you set it? Who was the child?

00:39:00.440 --> 00:39:03.680 line:100%
Just… a kid from Yuanlongli.

00:39:07.200 --> 00:39:08.840 line:100%
Back in '97,

00:39:09.840 --> 00:39:12.240 line:100%
he saw me in Yuanlongli.

00:39:12.320 --> 00:39:13.960 line:100%
NEW YORK BLOCK

00:39:30.560 --> 00:39:33.000 line:100%
<i>I ran into him again in 2002.</i>

00:39:33.080 --> 00:39:35.160 line:100%
<i>I thought he recognized me.</i>

00:39:35.240 --> 00:39:36.920 line:100%
<i>He also knew that cop.</i>

00:39:37.000 --> 00:39:40.920 line:100%
<i>Qiao Suqing and I couldn't risk anything.</i>

00:39:45.760 --> 00:39:46.840 line:20%
Fire! Fire!

00:39:46.920 --> 00:39:48.800 line:100%
CAROUSEL'S DEAD HEAT

00:39:48.880 --> 00:39:50.160 line:100%
Fire! Fire!

00:39:50.240 --> 00:39:52.320 line:100%
-Call the police!
-Call the police!

00:39:52.400 --> 00:39:53.840 line:100%
Put it out!

00:39:53.920 --> 00:39:55.000 line:100%
Danger!

00:39:59.680 --> 00:40:02.760 line:100%
POLICE

00:40:05.520 --> 00:40:07.200 line:100%
You burned Keyboard to death.

00:40:11.840 --> 00:40:15.360 line:100%
Officer, you knew that boy?

00:40:15.440 --> 00:40:17.240 line:100%
Xu Meng, have you no conscience?

00:40:17.320 --> 00:40:19.280 line:100%
Xiaohe! Xiaohe! Sit down.

00:40:20.520 --> 00:40:21.960 line:100%
Sit down.

00:40:23.480 --> 00:40:24.520 line:100%
Sit down.

00:40:30.480 --> 00:40:31.320 line:100%
Go on.

00:40:32.560 --> 00:40:35.040 line:100%
I didn't mean to kill the boy.

00:40:35.720 --> 00:40:38.200 line:100%
It's just that when
I came back to Weiyang,

00:40:39.080 --> 00:40:41.040 line:100%
I was so angry.

00:40:41.600 --> 00:40:44.400 line:20%
RENTAL AGREEMENT

00:41:10.640 --> 00:41:13.360 line:100%
Why are you here? You didn't even tell me.

00:41:14.280 --> 00:41:15.480 line:100%
When is Yao coming back?

00:41:17.040 --> 00:41:20.160 line:100%
Didn't I say end of the year?
What's wrong?

00:41:24.720 --> 00:41:27.320 line:100%
Sister, our home is ready.

00:41:27.400 --> 00:41:29.000 line:100%
Do you want to go see it with me?

00:41:31.160 --> 00:41:34.400 line:100%
Meng, I… I can't go with you yet.

00:41:35.240 --> 00:41:37.440 line:100%
I have… work. I still need my job.

00:41:39.120 --> 00:41:40.800 line:100%
You must be thirsty.
I'll get you some water.

00:41:53.120 --> 00:41:54.600 line:100%
You're moving?

00:41:55.440 --> 00:41:58.080 line:100%
Didn't you say you'd stay till it's sold?

00:42:00.840 --> 00:42:02.960 line:100%
Well, this place leaks,

00:42:03.040 --> 00:42:05.880 line:100%
and since we're selling it,
I figured I'd move out first.

00:42:06.440 --> 00:42:09.520 line:100%
Closer to work, save on commute.

00:42:10.480 --> 00:42:13.720 line:100%
Then don't rent a place. Come with me.

00:42:13.800 --> 00:42:16.520 line:100%
When Yao gets back, you can come back.

00:42:17.320 --> 00:42:19.840 line:100%
You can find work anywhere, right?

00:42:23.480 --> 00:42:27.200 line:100%
Meng, I think I should wait.

00:42:27.280 --> 00:42:30.760 line:100%
Let's wait a bit longer. Okay?

00:42:33.920 --> 00:42:37.760 line:100%
Sister, what are you waiting for?

00:42:37.840 --> 00:42:41.720 line:100%
Is it this place,
something here you can't leave?

00:42:43.200 --> 00:42:44.320 line:100%
Or is it…

00:42:46.400 --> 00:42:48.120 line:100%
someone you can't let go of?

00:42:50.440 --> 00:42:51.880 line:100%
How could that be?

00:42:52.840 --> 00:42:54.760 line:100%
I just… I already paid three months' rent.

00:42:54.840 --> 00:42:57.280 line:100%
Leaving now would be a waste.

00:42:58.480 --> 00:42:59.920 line:100%
I'm going to the restroom.

00:43:47.560 --> 00:43:49.480 line:100%
<i>For the next few days,</i>

00:43:50.160 --> 00:43:51.760 line:100%
I didn't leave Weiyang.

00:43:52.360 --> 00:43:54.080 line:100%
I just wanted to find out

00:43:55.280 --> 00:43:59.640 line:100%
who the man in those slippers really was.